    {
      "id": 56,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        100,
        2766
      ],
      "size": [
        460,
        790
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 24,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Loop (turbo v2: 8-step LoRA v1.1, 8 steps)\n\nSame as the Turbo workflow with the newer v1.1 turbo LoRA. In our tests it removed the every-other-frame judder the v1.0 LoRA could show on fast motion, at the same speed.\n\nSeamless loop without first/last frames. **MiniMax H3 Loop** samples the latent with its end wrapped around to its start, so the model joins the end to the start like any other cut-free stretch of video.\n\n**Length** must be 17k+5 frames. The loop is 17k frames:\n\n| length | loop | seconds |\n|---|---|---|\n| 107 | 102 | 4.25 |\n| 158 | 153 | 6.4 |\n| 209 | 204 | 8.5 |\n| 260 | 255 | 10.6 |\n| 311 | 306 | 12.75 |\n| 362 | 357 | 14.9 |\n\nThese keep the audio loop exact. `pad_clips` adds 17 frames of wrapped context on each side while sampling, with `pad_clips` 1, 311 becomes 345 frames (within H3's 362-frame maximum) and 362 becomes 396 (past it), and longer runs are slower.\n\n**Prompt:** a loop has to end where it started.\n- Start with `Locked-off static camera, no pan, no zoom.`\n- One continuous or repeating action on a large, clear subject: pulsing, rotating, swaying, drifting, orbiting.\n- Keep light and environment steady. End with `Continuous, smooth, unbroken motion throughout.`\n- Avoid `[0s-2s]` timelines, \"then\"/\"begins\"/\"finally\", and one-way changes (lights switching on, things appearing, camera moves).\n- Fine turbulent texture (blowing sand, rain streaks, smoke) can pop at the loop point. Keep it secondary or try another seed.\n- Steady ambient sound loops invisibly; a single sound event repeats every loop.\n\nSee PROMPTING.md in the pack for the full guide and example prompts.\n\n**Reference image:** un-bypass Load Image and refer to it as `<Picture 1>` in the prompt. Prefer it to first/last frame or Add Guide anchors, which can make the loop point jump and the exposure drift.\n\n**Decode:** MiniMax H3 Loop Decode decodes with wrapped context on both sides and outputs exactly one loop of frames and audio.\n\n**Smoothing:** Loop Interpolate runs FILM or RIFE across the whole loop, including the last-to-first frames, and sets the video fps (24 x multiplier). H3 always generates at 24 fps; don't just raise the fps in Create Video, that only speeds the clip up.\n\n**Models** (put each in `ComfyUI/models/<folder>`; ComfyUI also offers to download missing ones):\n- `diffusion_models`: [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n- `loras`: [minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.1_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Minimax-h3-Turbo/resolve/main/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.1_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n- `text_encoders`: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n- `vae`: [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- `vae`: [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)"
      ],
      "title": "Author's notes (ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-Loop)"
    }
